      "summary": "This song is a melancholy look at a codependent relationship, where Nina Persson sings from the perspective of a woman too attached to her significant other, who would let them do anything to her as long as they don’t leave. It follows the tone of other tracks, such as “Lovefool” from The Cardigans' third album, First Band on the Moon. <a href=\"http://www.last.fm/music/The+Cardigans/_/Step+On+Me\">Read more on Last.fm</a>.",
